  "description": "SelectiveMAE is an efficient masked image modeling (MIM) method for remote sensing foundation models, pre-trained on the large-scale OpticalRS-13M dataset (13 million optical satellite images). It accelerates pre-training by dynamically encoding and reconstructing semantically rich patch tokens, reducing computational overhead while maintaining or improving downstream performance.",
